      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues exceed analyst expectations",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹14.96 (up from ₹13.04 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹12.6b (up 9.9% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹1.15b (up 14% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 9.1% (up from 8.8% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue exceeded analyst estimates by 5.1%. Earnings per share (EPS) also surpassed analyst estimates by 5.1%. Revenue is forecast to grow 12% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 12% growth forecast for the Logistics industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 18% per year.",
